  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTEGRATED WATER RESOURCES MANAGEMENT PROGRAMME FOR THE LAKE VICTORIA BASIN WITH HIGH PRIORITY INVESTMENTS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IWRM Programme will contribute to the improvement of the water quality and availability through strategic and sustainable management of the Lake Victoria Basin (LVB) region which is a designated economic growth zone . This Programme will enhance the regional economic integration and will provide a contribution to the preservation of Biodiversity and the prevention of conflicts due to shared water resources in the Lake Victoria Basin. The IWRM Programme supports the design of an Integrated</narrative>
  </description>
